// غربال اراتستن، آرایهٔ بولی اندازه‌دار و علامت‌گذاری مضرب‌های اعداد اول را آزمایش می‌کند.
// Tests the Sieve of Eratosthenes, sized Boolean arrays, and marking prime multiples.
// The sieve finds every prime up to the inclusive limit without testing each value separately.
func find_primes(number limit) -> number[] {
    bool[] composite = bool[limit + 1];
    number[] primes = [];

    for (number candidate = 2; candidate <= limit; candidate++) {
        if (!composite[candidate]) {
            primes = array_add(primes, candidate);

            if (candidate * candidate <= limit) {
                for (number multiple = candidate * candidate; multiple <= limit; multiple += candidate) {
                    composite[multiple] = true;
                }
            }
        }
    }

    return primes;
}

_main_() {
    number[] primes = find_primes(30);
    for (prime in primes) {
        print(prime);
    }
}
